AFFIDAVIT

I, Mr. Rajesh Gupta, S/o Shri K.L. Gupta, aged 42 years,
residing at 8, DLF Phase 3, Gurgaon – 122 002,
Site Engineer, M/s. Power Grid Infra Projects Pvt. Ltd.,
do hereby solemnly affirm and state as follows:

1. I am the Site Engineer for the 220 kV GIS Substation Project and am fully conversant
   with the facts stated herein.

2. I was present at the site continuously from 25.05.2024 onwards and have personal
   knowledge of all site activities and RVPNL's actions/inactions.

3. Regarding the 220 kV GIS equipment supply delay: I personally visited the RVPNL
   office on 15.12.2024, 01.02.2025, and 20.04.2025 to request equipment supply.
   Each time, I was told that the equipment procurement was "under process" and would
   be supplied "shortly".

4. The delay in equipment supply directly affected:
   - Tower crane remained idle (daily hire cost: ₹35,000)
   - 45 specialized electrical workers remained idle (daily wage cost: ₹24,750)
   - Testing and commissioning equipment remained idle
   - Civil works for GIS room could not be completed without equipment dimensions

5. I have recorded all these delays in my daily site diary entries from
   December 2024 to September 2025.

6. Regarding the Transmission Line RoW: I personally supervised the preparation
   of the tower foundation locations. However, from Tower No. 15 to Tower No. 45,
   the RoW was not available due to land acquisition issues.

7. This caused complete work stoppage for 120 days in the transmission line section.

8. Regarding the additional bay (VO-01): On 15.09.2024, the RVPNL Superintending Engineer
   verbally instructed us to include an additional 220 kV bay in the substation design.
   I have recorded this instruction in my site diary dated 15.09.2024.

9. We executed the additional bay work as per the instruction. However, RVPNL has not
   formally priced this in a Variation Order.

10. All facts stated above are within my personal knowledge and are true to the best of my
    information and belief. No part of it is false and nothing material has been concealed.

Deponent: Rajesh Gupta
Date: 01.12.2025
Place: Gurgaon

Sworn before me:
Oath Commissioner / Notary Public